window.products.push({"id":129081,"name":"Lauria Pour Over Coffee Dripper - Stainless Steel Coffee Filter and Maker - Reusable Coffee Cone Brewer with Paperless Double Layer Fine Mesh Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GMT5PgG5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pour over coffee brewing effectively gives you control over each step of the coffee making process. With your stainless steel coffee dripper, you can experiment and find that perfect calibration of water and grind for your unique taste. Here are the steps to making pour over coffee (paperless): First, \"rinse\" the pour over coffee maker with hot water; this serves to preheat the filter before use. Second, dump this water and fill the filter with ground coffee, gently tapping the edges to even the bed. Third, begin a brief stage of pre-infusion: pour about 10% of the total water volume evenly across the coffee, start a timer, and wait 30-45 seconds. This releases gases that build up during roasting, an event seen in the \"blooming\" of fresh coffee. Fourth and immediately afterwards, continue pouring in a slow, circular, in-and-out motion for about 90 seconds or so. Fifth, continue pouring directly into the middle of the pour over coffee maker, keeping the water level consistent. Shoot for a total brew time of 3:00-3:30. Lastly, remove the filter from the server (cup or pot), dump the grounds, scrub the filter, and serve coffee straight from your server of choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GMT5PgG5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lauria","source_asin":"B01F6OI1ZK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F6OI1ZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F6OI1ZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
