window.products.push({"id":129184,"name":"EUHOMY Nugget Ice Makers Countertop, Max 33lbs/24H, 2 Ways Water Refill, LED Light, Self-Cleaning Pebble Ice Maker with Basket and Scoop, for Home/Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ytnb7vGIL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"33LBS/24H BIGGER CAPACITY & BEST CHEWABLE ICE: Enjoy the first batch of fresh ice in 12mins at 77℉. With a 2.6Qt water tank and powerful compressor, our nugget ice maker quickly makes a max of 33lbs ice per day and holds up to 3.5lbs at a time. Compared with those hard cubes, the crunchy soft nugget ice not only cools drinks quickly but also retains the real taste of fresh drinks even providing chewable joy, which is perfect for cocktails, whisky, and other beverages. TWO-WAYS WATER REFILL & MORE ICE: Auto/Manual refill water switchable; Simply connect your sonic ice maker to the water supply system at home by connecting the included inlet pipe to the water inlet connector on the back panel, turn on the faucet. Surely, it's also convenient to add water manually, accessible to outdoor activities like parties. A cool feature of recycling any melted ice will go back into the flow of making ice for maximum water efficiency which ensures endless ice. SELF-CLEANING & SMART MULTIFUNCTION: Our one-touch self-cleaning for effortless clean-up. Keep pressing the “CLEAN” for 3s after adding water to run automatic mode for 15mins. Not only are your hands-free but also you get a clean pellet ice maker. And the nugget ice maker countertop uses advanced infrared sensing technology. The \"ICE FULL\" indicator flashes to remind you to take out the ice when the drawer is full and add water by flashing \"ADD WATER\". CONVENIENCE & QUIETER & MONEY-SAVING: Adopts the visualized design, allowing direct monitoring of the interior through the large viewing window and opening the drawer at any time. Another innovative design is the internal light. When the ambient light is very dark, it’s also easily for removing ice to cool drinks. Surprisingly, our nugget ice maker completes the ice-making fairly efficiently but with little noise. Also, the 0.17kwh energy consumption saves your electricity bills. SUPERIOR QUALITY & WARRANTY PROMISE: Include a 2-point inlet pipe, drip tray, ice collecting tray, ice scoop, and manual. Our Mission is committed to providing customers with premium Euhomy ice maker at a reasonable price. We offer ① 12-month warranty from the original purchase date; ② Lifetime technical service support. Suppose you have any questions about using our Ice Makers Countertop, PLEASE reach out to us anytime! Our 7*24-hour customer support is always ready to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ytnb7vGIL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B0C4T6G356","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4T6G356","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4T6G356","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
