window.products.push({"id":129292,"name":"Replacement For Samsung RF261BEAESG Refrigerator Water Filter - by Refresh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51acKlhTYJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"\" \" Refresh R-9101 Replacement For Samsung DA29-00020B / HAF-CIN/EXP Refrigerator Water Filter Certified by NSF international against NSF/ANSF standard 42 (ISO 9001) for materials and structural integrity requirements. Gold seal Awarded Filters by Water Quality Association Effiectively keeps Water Clean by Removing Chlorine, Taste and Odor The Filter has a High Flow Rate which gives plenty of Water in Less Time. Comes with a 6-month life-cycle, and cleans 400 Gallons of Water Economical Refrigerator Water Filter, Ideal for brands like Samsung and Kenmore and many more. Easy to replace, hassle-free installation. Replacement Water Filter for following Models: Samsung Refrigerator Water Filters: DA29-00020B, HAF-CIN/EXP, DA29-00020A, HAF-CIN, HAF-CIN-EXP, HAF-CINEXP, HAFCIN Kenmore Refrigerator Water Filters: 46-9101, 469101, 9101, 09101 Description : The Refresh R-9101 Replacement Water Filter for Samsung DA29-00020B / Kenmore 9101 is a high-quality water filter for popular and well established models of refrigerators. The replacement filter is in continual testing to offer our valued clients the best solutions on the market at all times. Water can contain dirt, rust, chlorine, or water-hardening minerals, which can cause health issues, damage to your refrigerator, and leave your water and ice cloudy and undrinkable. The filter has an internal coconut medium that efficiently removes taste and odor, and BPA free exterior casting eliminates chlorine. Apart from this, the filter removes cysts, lead, asbestos and turbidity from the water.It has a high flow rate which supplies ample water in few seconds. It does not remove beneficial minerals providing healthy drinkable water. The filter has an hassle free installation process, requiring no special tools. It is a simple push and twist procedure to secure a tight leak-free grip. The filter is quite economical compared to other brands, without compromising on quality","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51acKlhTYJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"636643","source_asin":"B07TZ6S288","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TZ6S288","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TZ6S288","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
