window.products.push({"id":129359,"name":"Fresh Flow Produce Preserver Replaces Part W10346771a (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Aia+FJMrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To Replace Your Produce Preserver:1) Find the Produce Preserver housing inside the refrigerator. 2) Open the housing by pulling up and out on the back. 3) Remove the Produce Preserver pouches from the packaging and place them into the housing.  About the Produce Preserver:Fruits and vegetables produce a naturally occurring chemical called Ethylene. Ethylene induces natural ripening in fruits and vegetables. In fact, a number of fruits and vegetables emit small amounts of ethylene gas during their ripening process which leads to an increased level of ethylene gas in the air. This in turn threatens the life cycle of post-harvest fruits and vegetables. Our preservers work by absorbing the ethylene gas that produce naturally gives off lengthening the life of produce Additional Information:You will receive enough preservers for 1 use. Each pack can last up to 6 months. Please note that the indicator strips are not included in this sale","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Aia+FJMrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Natural Filters","source_asin":"B0776HR48G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0776HR48G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0776HR48G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
