window.products.push({"id":129469,"name":"Nictemaw Full-Automatic Portable Washing Machine, 13.5lbs Compact Laundry Washer Machine with 10 programs & 8 Water Level Selections for Dorm, Apartme","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618SavKN2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Control Panel】There are 10 programs, 8 water level selections and indicator light on the control panel. You can select the appropriate programs and water level according to different cloth to meet your needs. Simply set the washing machine program, and then just leave it alone to work. 【Full-automatic & Portable】With compact and lightweight design, this full-automatic washing machine is portable for you to easily move it around, ideal for a compact living space such as dorms, apartments, RVs or even camping. The stainless steel inner tub for bearing loads up to 13lbs clothes at one time, which can meet all your daily laundry needs. 【Automatic Balance Adjustment】When the laundries in the tub are not placed evenly, spinning may cause violent vibration. But the balance adjustment function will start automatically to adjust the imbalance if vibration is beyond certain level. Besides, bottom feet can be adjustable as your needs. 【24-hour Smart Delay & Child Lock】This portable washer is equipped with 2-24 hour smart delay washing function. You can set the desired start time of washing in advance as your need. In addition, this washer has a child lock function. Once child lock function is set, all buttons will be locked. 【NOTE】The drainage hose has to be placed on the floor level, which is gravity drainage and empties from the BOTTOM of the unit so far. You can place it on a higher platform or need a low level or floor drain for it. Nictemaw provides 12-month replacement warranty for any quality issue and lifetime support guarantee. For any questions, please feel free to contact our customer service team, and they will respond to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618SavKN2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nictemaw","source_asin":"B08XM9YQCW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XM9YQCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XM9YQCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
