window.products.push({"id":129532,"name":"Swift Green Filters SGF-M9 Replacement water filter for UKF8001,EDR4RXD1,FILTER 4,EFF-6007A,46-9005,46-9006,CLCH101, 1, White, 1 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cRiDge9HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Help save the environment with this \"green\" filter that is an original equipment replacement. Compared to Conventional carbon-based filters, Swift green filter products are . Conventional carbon filters are produced by a burning process called open pit charring which release pollution and greenhouse emissions into the air. Green filter components are produced with a new technology that carbonizes dried coconut shells in an enclosed self-sustaining system while capturing and converting the emissions into useful thermal energy. The filters are NSF Certified which ensures consumers of drinking clean and safe water. The filters are tested and certified by NSF International to NSF / ANSI Standard 42 for the aesthetic reduction of chlorine taste and odor and nominal particulate class I, as well as to Standard 53 for the reduction of Atrazine, Lindane, Lead, Turbidity, and Cysts. This filter keeps a healthy level of fluoride, a water additive that promotes strong teeth. Swift Green Filters provided complete filtration systems and equipment for residential and commercial uses. Whether you are looking for a system to filter your a single kitchen, the whole house, or your business, Swift Green Filter has a solution to fit your needs and budget. Maytag Models: UKF-8001, UKF8001AXX, UKF8001AXXT, UKF8001AXX-750, UFK8001AXX-750, Puriclean II - 67003526, 67003527, 67003528 Sears/Kenmore: 46-9005, 469005, 9005, 9005P 46-9006, 469006, 9006, 9006P 46-9992, 469992, 9992, 9992P 469005750, 469005-750, 46-9005-750 469006750, 469006-750, 46-9006-750 04609005000, 04609006000 KitchenAid: 4396395, 8171032, 8171249 Amana: 12589203, 12589206 12589208, 12589210 Whirlpool: OWF51, WF50-NI500, WF50-WI500, 67003523, WF50-KWI500, WF50-NI300, WF50-KNI300, OWF50-WI500, OWF50-NI300, 8171032, 8171249 From the Manufacturer Swift Green Filters is the green alternative in water filtration. We think that sustainability should be at the forefront of every business model. Our unique carbonization process reduces harmful impurities while improving the quality of your drinking water. We offer a variety of refrigerator and food service filter replacements. Our products are 100% recyclable and all materials used in our products are UL and Gold Seal certified. You can recycle your used filter by shipping it back to us! We are proud to say all our products are made within North America.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cRiDge9HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swift Green Filters","source_asin":"B00L8XU8XW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L8XU8XW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L8XU8XW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
