window.products.push({"id":129571,"name":"Dc32-00007a Samsung Dryer Thermistor Dv40j3000ew/a2 Dv42h5000ew/a3 Dv42h5200ew/a3 Dv45h7000ew/a2 Dv328aer/xaa Dv393etpawr/a1 Dv48j7700ew/a2 Dve52m7750","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wI2m5B++S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 DC32-00007A Dryer Thermistor - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4201716, 2068429, PS4204984. It is attached to the blower housing. Dryer Thermistor is compatible with Samsung, Kenmore, Skuttle appliances. It is responsible for measuring the temperature and sending signals to the dryer's control board to adjust the heating elements accordingly. Our thermistors fit hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Samsung Dc32-00007a? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. DC32-00007A Dryer Thermistor Direct Replacement will help if there's no heat or not enough heat, appliance shuts off too soon, or doesn't start. The replacement process involves removing the old thermistor and attaching the new one with screws or other fastening mechanisms provided. 💡 Where is thermistor on Samsung dryer? The DC32-00007A Thermistor on a Samsung dryer is typically located on the blower housing, which is usually located near the front of the dryer drum. To access the Samsung Dryer Thermistor Dc32-00007a, you will need to unplug the dryer and remove the front panel of the dryer. Our Samsung Dryer Thermistor #sam-dc32-00007a meet or exceed all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Dc32-00007a Samsung Thermistor is a small device that senses the temperature inside the dryer and sends a signal to the dryer's control board to regulate the temperature. A faulty thermistor can cause the dryer to overheat, which can damage your clothes or even start a fire. It can also cause the dryer to not heat up at all, which will prevent your clothes from drying. Additionally, a faulty thermistor can cause the dryer to shut off prematurely, which can be frustrating and inconvenient. 💡 The thermistor is made of high-quality materials to ensure its durability and reliability. It is important to ensure that the replacement thermistor is compatible with your dryer model. Popular Models: dv210aew/xaa, dv328aer/xaa, dv393etpawr/a1, dv40j3000ew/a2, dv42h5000ew/a3, dv42h5200ew/a3, dv45h7000ew/a2, dv48j7700ew/a2, dve52m7750v/a3, dv220aew/xaa, dv395etpasu/a1, dv448aep/xaa, dv48h7400ew/a2, dv400ewhdwr/aa, dv40j3000gw/a2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wI2m5B++S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07N8QT47V","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N8QT47V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N8QT47V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
