window.products.push({"id":129700,"name":"Giantex Portable Washing Machine, 2 in 1 Laundry Washer and Spinner Combo, 22lbs Capacity 13.2 lbs Washing 8.8 lbs Spinning, w/Timer Control, Built-in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+73JWSmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extra Convenience from Twin Tub: Our portable washer features two separate tubs with dual functions, which brings you a lot of convenience in washing and spinning clothes at the same time. More, transparent cover allows you to check the washing/spinning process conveniently at any time. Separate Time Setting & Diversified Mode: There are 15 minutes washing time and 5 minutes spin-drying time to facilitate daily use. You can choose the suitable washing/spinning time according to your needs. Additionally, 3 selected modes (soft/standard/drain) lets choose the corresponding mode to wash clothes of different materials. Compact but Abundant Design: Twin tub design with large capacity increases laundry efficiency and helps you save precious time. The washing tub can accommodate up to 13.2 lbs of clothes, while the dryer tub can hold up to 8.8 lbs. Measuring 25” x 14.5” x 27.5”, this compact mini washer is suitable for apartments, dormitories, balconies and RVs. High Performance & Silent Motor: Powerful motor performs well in durability, safety and smooth operation for low consumption and efficient laundry. 280W washing power and 160W spinner power free your hands with low noise. Besides, excess water will be automatically drained through the drain pipe when you turn the knob to drain. Fast Drainage & Simple Operation: The washing machine comes with 54” drain hose and powerful drain pump to quickly drain the excess water. The filter device collects unnecessary debris. Just drop clothes in, add laundry detergent, fill with water, set the timer, and you can start washing your clothes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+73JWSmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B09H4Q6WQR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H4Q6WQR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H4Q6WQR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":129701,"name":"ZLINE 30\" 4.0 cu. ft. Dual Fuel Range with Gas Stove and Electric Oven in Black Stainless Steel (RAB-30)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3424.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m+5DyAHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Professional Dual Fuel cooking blends high performance of a gas cooktop and electric convection oven The premium grade black stainless steel is created by an atom-bonded technique called PVD ensuring built to last quality 4 cu. ft oven capacity for maximal space and convenience with everyday cooking An Industry First - Limited lifetime warranty on the Italian burners includes parts replacements for burners and burner caps, and parts and labor for the spark tip if parts prove to be defective in materials or workmanship. Every range comes equipped with an LP conversion kit to convert from natural gas to propane; this conversion process must be done by a professional","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m+5DyAHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Z Line Kitchen and Bath","source_asin":"B07V59JLFG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V59JLFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V59JLFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
