window.products.push({"id":129710,"name":"6-Pack Air Filter Factory Replacement For Broan S97007894, 97007894 Range Hood Aluminum Grease Mesh Filter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911GRk5IWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Part Number – S97007894, 97007894 Aluminum Mesh Range Hood Grease Filter Replacement For A Range Hood. Quality – Proudly Made In The USA Our Compatible S97007894, 97007894 Aluminum Mesh Grease Filter Is Made From A High Quality Aluminum. The Filter Contains An Exclusive Multi-Layer Aluminum Media For Maximum Filtration And Extra Durability. There Are Overlapping Joints To Stop Snagging. Application –The Aluminum Mesh Grease Filter Is Installed Underneath The Range Hood Above The Stove Top Facing Downward. Filters Are Recommended To Be Hand Washed Using A Mild Dish Detergent And Warm Water. Allow The Filter To Soak In Hot Water And Dish Detergent For Approximately 1 Hour. Then Using A Light Bristled Brush, Gently Scrub The Filters Surface. Rinse With Water And Allow Time To Dry. Guarantee Filter Fit – This Filter Measures 9-7/8\" x 11-5/8\" x 3/8\" With A Pull Tab On The Long Side. Before Ordering It Is Always Best To Measure Your Existing Filter Using A Measuring Tape Or Ruler. Quantity - Package Contains 6 Filters For Easy And Convenient Replacement. Replacement Part Numbers Include 248697 97007894 97017455 97017456 97005683 99010130 99010152 S97017455 S97017456 S99010152 02X3446 S02X3446 S99010130 S97005683 1172282 1930458 1373057 RF200 AP5613327 AP5608402 AP2010888 WB02X3446 AP6009362 4341969 AH242176 8190259 4396389 PS242176 610007 4342003 WB2X3998 99010152 WP4396389 WB2X3446 S99010152 1172282 RHF0914 RHF0915 BPRPFA WB02X3998 EA242176 And Many More Partial Model Compatibility List: 883001, 883002, 883004, 883011, 883022, 883601, 883604, 883608, 883623, 883901, 883904, 884204, 884801, 884804, 884823, 893001, 893004, 893011, 893023, 893601, 893604, 893623, 893901, 893904, 894201, 894204, 894223, 894801, 894804, AP130BL, AP130SS, AP130WW, AP136BL, AP136SS, AP136WW, RP130BL, RP130SS, RP130WW, RP136BL, RP136SS, RP136WW Important – Before Placing Your Order, Please Check The Model Tag In Your Hood. The Model Tag Is Located Up Inside Of The Hood. The Filters Will Need To Be Removed To View The Model Tag. The Model Tag Will Show The Correct Grease Filter Part Number And The Correct Charcoal Carbon Filter Part Number For Your Range Hood. Match The Part Number To The Part In The Title Of The Listing To Ensure You Are Getting The Correct Filter. If You Have Any Questions, Please Feel Free To Contact Us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911GRk5IWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Air Filter Factory","source_asin":"B07DP6RCMX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DP6RCMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DP6RCMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
