window.products.push({"id":129725,"name":"Flexzion Ice Maker Machine For Countertop - Stainless Steel Automatic Portable Ice Cubes Maker with Scoop and Basket 2 Cube Sizes Up To 22 Pounds of I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Z4z0vw7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sometimes, we need more ice than our standard freezer can produce. How many times have you had to go to the nearest gas station just to buy several pounds of ice? If you purchase a great quality portable ice maker, you will no longer have to make such hasty trips and you'll save money in the long term because your ice maker will pay for itself. A very popular countertop appliance is the portable ice machine. It can be used for supplemental ice or for other purposes. While it’s commonly used in a kitchen environment, this countertop ice maker with its compact design can be used almost anywhere where you have electricity. A lot of people buy one for a small bar that they have in their home. The installation of a bulky freezer or refrigerator can require an enormous amount of effort, so a lot of people prefer to purchase a smaller appliance. As you might have gathered from the name, these appliances can be used almost anywhere, and they don’t require any installation. Specification: Daily Ice Output: 10kg / 24 hours Daily Ice Output: 10kg / 24 hours Ice Storage Capacity: 600 g (1.3 lbs) Ice Storage Capacity: 600 g (1.3 lbs) Water Reservoir Capacity: 1.7 Litres Water Reservoir Capacity: 1.7 Litres Voltage: AC 110-120V/60Hz Voltage: AC 110-120V/60Hz Power cord: 3 pins plug. Power cord: 3 pins plug. Package Content: 1 x Ice Maker Machine For Countertop - Stainless Steel Automatic Portable Ice Cubes Maker with Scoop and Basket 2 Cube Sizes Up To 22 Pounds of Ice Daily for Home Kitchen Restaurant Office Silver 1 x Ice Maker Machine For Countertop - Stainless Steel Automatic Portable Ice Cubes Maker with Scoop and Basket 2 Cube Sizes Up To 22 Pounds of Ice Daily for Home Kitchen Restaurant Office Silver","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Z4z0vw7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexzion","source_asin":"B0783B4GSN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0783B4GSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0783B4GSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
