window.products.push({"id":129760,"name":"KreAid Reusable Vertuo Capsule Refill Kit Easy Seal & Store Capsule Holder for Nespresso Vertuoline with 80 Premium Foil Seal Lids, Brush, Scoop (Reus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gh+Vs3xhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕Vertuoline Pods Refill Kit with Capsule Storage Design: Get your vertuo pods filling done with the non-slip KreAid Vertuo Capsule Workbench. Use one of the deep holes for filling coffee pods and the other for stacking cleaned empty capsules. The small deep hole on the far right is used to store a 10g spoon and a brush, which can easily scoop up the right amount of coffee powder to complete your personalized coffee capsule. (New version adds small hole to place brush upright) 🔧Easy-seal Nespresso Vertuo Pods Filling Holder: The deepened groove perfectly fits capsules with a capacity of 7.77oz and below, and it only takes 3 steps to make a new pod. ①Put the empty coffee pod in. ②Use spoon to fill the pods and use brush to remove the spilled coffee powder. ③Take out a piece of aluminum foil cover which included in the set, place it in the correct position and use the end of the brush to rotate along the edge. You will then be able to get a new capsule. 🌏Be a Protector of the Earth: Reduce the number of times to buy new capsules and reuse the existing Nespresso Vertuo Pods. While protecting the planet we live in, give yourself more choices of coffee flavors! Choose from different roasted beans and customize your coffee life. KreAid has always been committed to providing consumers with products made from reusable materials. One small step for you, one giant leap for the betterment of the planet. 🎁More Suggestions: Small space for storing coffee capsules? Not enough foil stickers for Vertuoline coffee capsules? Consider KreAid's “PVC Coffee Capsule Organizer Strips” and “Foil Lids for Vertuoline Refilling” to enrich your home personal coffee making bar. 📦What U Get: The package contains a coffee making holder made of BAMBOO, 80 pcs food-grade aluminum foil lids suitable for Nrespresso Vertuoline Pods, an extended fluffy brush, a 10g quantitative spoon, and several non-slip stickers. The main body of Nresspresso capsules is not included. If you have any questions about the product, please contact us and we will reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gh+Vs3xhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KreAid","source_asin":"B0C3Q12G6K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3Q12G6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3Q12G6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
