window.products.push({"id":129780,"name":"W11096268 w10758829 Water Inlet Valve OEM - w10853296 suitable for kenmore whirlpool washers - w11220230 water inlet valve exact fit wtw7300dw1, wtw85","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lQUZj7I+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【GENUINE W11096268 WATER INLET VALVE】-- The W11096268 W10758829 water inlet valve (GENUINE Original Part) controls the flow of water into the washing machine.It has two threaded ports with a diameter of 1.06 inches to connect to the hot and cold water hoses on the back of the washing machine. Each port is controlled by a solenoid valve that sends electric power to open and close the flow of hot and cold water based on settings for the wash temperature and signals from the water-level switch. ✅【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】--The W11096268 water inlet valve replaces W11220230, W10632527, W10758829, W10853296, 4591408, AP6329544, PS12349461, EAP12349461 for Whirl-pool,Ken-more,May-tag washing machine.★Compatible with the following models: WTW7000DW4, WTW8040DW0, 11026132412, 11020372710, 11020372711, 11026132410, 11026132411, 7MWTW7000EW0, 7MWTW7000EW1, 7MWTW7300EW0, 7MWTW7300EW1, MVW6200KW0, MVW6200KW1, MVW6200KW2, MVW6230HC0, MVW6230HC1, MVW6230HC, etc. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】--The W11096268 W10758829 water inlet valve support 365 DAYS return and exchange.★It can rectify the following symptoms:①when the error codes such as E1, F8, FL, LF, LO is displayed on your washing machine,②the washer not to fill properly or not fill at all,③leak from the inlet valve,④hot/cold water not being accepted into washer,⑤cannot run or is washed at the wrong water temperature. ✅【PERFECT SUBSTITUTE】-- The W11096268 washer water inlet valve (120V 60Hz)is designed with two threaded valves with blue & red mesh inserts, which can connect to the corresponding hot and cold water pipe ports at the back of the washing machine.This is a new GENUINE Whirlpool replacement part.★Replaces part numbers:wtw7000dw2, wtw7000dw3, wtw7040dw0, wtw7040dw1, wtw7040dw2, wtw7120hc0, wtw7300dc0, wtw7300dw0, wtw7300dw1, wtw7300dw2, wtw8000dw1, wtw8000dw2, wtw8000dw3, wtw8000dw4, wtw8000dw5, wtw8040dw1, wtw8040dw2, wtw8040dw3,etc. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】-- Unplug the washer and shut off the water supply before installing this W11096268 W10758829 water inlet valve. The required tools are screwdrivers, pliers, and wrenches.Start by twisting electrical connections from the old valve with pliers. Removing them will give you better access to the screws holding the intake valve in place. Then the old valve is pulled out, the new valve is pushed in,everything else is buckled on, the hose is connected and opened.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lQUZj7I+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B085PRLRSL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085PRLRSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B085PRLRSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
