window.products.push({"id":129880,"name":"30 Inch Gas Cooktop with 6 Metal Knob, Dalxo 5 Italy Defendi Burner Gas Stovetop, Food-grade Stainless Steel Built-In Gas Hob, NG/LPG Convertible Gas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":318.02,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CjwE4ldfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"15000 BTU Powerful Middle Burner: Triple ring center burner outputs large heat to boil water quickly and the small ones work great for fine simmering by flame adjustment. Designed with 5 world-class Italy Defendi burners, it has high performance and cooks evenly for boiling, stir-frying, steaming and melting. Perfect for large family meals. High-Quality for 30\" Gas Cooktop: Dalxo provide an extra metal knob, also coming with the same 5 of them to withstand high temperatures. Made of food-grade 304 stainless steel, our well-made unit makes excellent corrosion resistance and convenient cleaning. Plus, continuous heavy cast iron grates safely slide large skillets across the cooking area. Simple to Install by NG/LPG Kit: Dimensions 30’’L*20.1W’’*3.54’’H. Come with a template for countertop cutting 26.97\"L*18.5\" W*2.36”H. Fast to convert NG (factory-installed) to LPG by 5 providing nozzles. Include the gas regulator and elbow. Facing the cooktop, the gas inlet is on the left rear corner. Upgrade your old existing drop-in stovetop and install it in the kitchen, outdoor cooking area, renovated mobile home and cabin. Easily Removable Cast Iron Grates for Cleaning: Cleanup is a breeze, just remove durable grates to clean the top with water and cleaner. Use stainless steel mild detergent and damp cloth to get a nice shiny result. Underneath the knobs are debris prevention arc circles to avoid dirt and spills falling into the enclosed space. Please take care when lifting the grates so as not to scratch the cooktop. Gas Stovetop with Safety Features: The thermocouple protection with flame failure device (FFD) checks and auto shut off leaky gas to ensure safety in an emergency. Additionally, electric ignition needs to push and turn the knob counterclockwise, avoiding your children causing injury or damage. Prefect for RV or in-home applications.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CjwE4ldfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalxo","source_asin":"B0BHVX84R2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHVX84R2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHVX84R2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
