window.products.push({"id":129957,"name":"Cenipar Dryer Vent Hose-4 inch Ducting Vent Hose(4 inch 8 feet) with 2 Clamps and STV-90 Dryer Duct Connector Dryer Hose Snap Fit 4in Vent Ducting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GqN+FIM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑PART NUMBER: Cenipar Dryer Vent Hose- Flexible Aluminum Foil Ducting Vent Hose(4 inch 8 feet) with 1 X 8 in Flexible Aluminum Foil Ducting Vent Hose&2 X metal Clamps. Cenipar STV-90 Drying Tube Fitting, DIY Simple Dryer Ventilation Connection Kit with 1* 90 elbow, 1* drying hose clamp, 1* plastic drying hose. ☑ WHAT IT IS: Dryer Vent Hose 4\" Duct Vent Hose is a flexible vent hose made of high quality flame retardant aluminum that measures 4\" (diameter) x 8 feet (length) when fully unfolded. The silicone seal in the STV-90 gives you a sealed dryer connection, making your dryer more efficient while consuming less energy and saving on electricity bills. With our newest STV-90 dryer duct connector design, you can install any 4\" vent pipe or 4\" flexible dryer hose, curved or straight to match. ☑EASY INSTALLATION:To ensure safety, bring work gloves and unplug the dryer first. Step 1: Tightly combine the drying hose clamp with the Dryer Vent Hoseto prevent the drying hose clamp from falling off the dryer vent hose. Step 2: Combine the protruding part of the dryer vent elbow with what you just finished in step 1, so that they keep a tight connection. Step 3: Insert the sealing ring into the other interface of the dryer exhaust elbow and finally connect it with the dryer vent. ☑PLACE OF USE:Aluminum foil duct dryer ventilation hose is mainly used for duct fan systems of various air circulation and ventilation projects, including hydroponic planting rooms and tents, bathrooms and attics, heating and cooling equipment and other equipment. The STV-90 is used for the air duct connector of the dryer. The strong adhesive silicone seals create a good seal between the pipes and fittings, which can prevent the hoses on the back of the dryer from rupturing. ☑WHY CHOOSE US:Our dryer vent hoses and 90 degree elbow dryer duct connectors are made of high-quality materials and can be reused without kinking the hose or losing airflow. Our company is committed to providing you with high-quality products, so that you can buy with confidence and use with confidence. If for any reason you are not completely satisfied, you can request an exchange or a full refund without asking any questions. Buy with confidence!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GqN+FIM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cenipar","source_asin":"B0BS9CCMHW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-129957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS9CCMHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS9CCMHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
